src/backend/utils/adt/selfuncs.c:index_other_operands_eval_cost|NodeTag|T_RestrictInfo	ELSEWHERE	RestrictInfo is not dispatched as a Node in pgrust; index clauses carry rinfo.clause (selfuncs.rs index_other_operands_eval_cost); witness: fixtures/walker-arms-witness.sql
src/backend/commands/explain.c:ExplainTargetRel|NodeTag|T_BitmapHeapScan,T_CteScan,T_CustomScan,T_ForeignScan,T_FuncExpr,T_FunctionScan,T_IndexOnlyScan,T_IndexScan,T_ModifyTable,T_NamedTuplestoreScan,T_SampleScan,T_SeqScan,T_TableFuncScan,T_TidRangeScan,T_TidScan,T_ValuesScan,T_WorkTableScan	ELSEWHERE	C switches on the plan tag only to pick the RTE; explain/src/node.rs ExplainTargetRel takes the rti and dispatches on rte.rtekind directly; witness: fixtures/walker-arms-witness.sql
src/backend/executor/execAmi.c:ExecSupportsMarkRestore|NodeTag|T_CustomScan,T_GroupResultPath,T_MinMaxAggPath	ELSEWHERE	C's T_Result arm returns false for MinMaxAggPath/GroupResultPath; costsize.rs exec_supports_mark_restore `_ => false` after the ProjectionPath check is the same; CustomScan UNPORTED; witness: fixtures/walker-arms-witness.sql
src/backend/optimizer/path/costsize.c:has_indexed_join_quals|NodeTag|T_BitmapHeapScan,T_IndexOnlyScan,T_IndexScan	ELSEWHERE	C switches on pathtype; Rust matches PathNode::IndexPath (both T_IndexScan and T_IndexOnlyScan) and PathNode::BitmapHeapPath; witness: fixtures/walker-arms-witness.sql
src/backend/optimizer/util/pathnode.c:path_is_reparameterizable_by_child|NodeTag|T_CustomPath,T_GatherPath	UNREACHABLE	unreachable: partial paths are never parameterized (pathnode.c add_partial_path), so a GatherPath never carries a parent parameterization to translate; T_ForeignPath was a real gap (postgres_fdw scan paths parameterized by the outer parent under a partitionwise nested loop were refused instead of reparameterized) and is ported C-exactly; CustomPath UNPORTED; witness: fixtures/walker-arms-witness.sql
src/backend/optimizer/util/pathnode.c:reparameterize_path_by_child|NodeTag|T_CustomPath,T_GatherPath	UNREACHABLE	unreachable: partial paths are never parameterized (pathnode.c add_partial_path), so a GatherPath never carries a parent parameterization to translate; T_ForeignPath was a real gap (postgres_fdw scan paths parameterized by the outer parent under a partitionwise nested loop were refused instead of reparameterized) and is ported C-exactly; CustomPath UNPORTED; witness: fixtures/walker-arms-witness.sql
src/backend/optimizer/util/plancat.c:build_physical_tlist|RTEKind|RTE_NAMEDTUPLESTORE,RTE_RELATION,RTE_RESULT	ELSEWHERE	RTE_RELATION is the fall-through tail of createplan.rs build_physical_tlist; RTE_RESULT/RTE_NAMEDTUPLESTORE never reach it because use_physical_tlist rejects those rtekinds first (both trees); witness: fixtures/walker-arms-witness.sql
src/backend/catalog/dependency.c:find_expr_references_walker|RTEKind|RTE_JOIN,RTE_NAMEDTUPLESTORE	UNREACHABLE	unreachable: RTE_JOIN: the merged-column coercions C records from joinaliasvars are the same functions already recorded from the join quals (pg_depend byte-identical on JOIN USING across int/numeric/bigint); RTE_NAMEDTUPLESTORE: the C error needs a persistent object built over a transition table, which no utility statement can see (both trees answer "relation does not exist"); witness: fixtures/walker-arms-witness.sql
src/backend/commands/explain.c:ExplainNode|NodeTag|T_CustomScan,T_CustomScanState	UNPORTED	CustomScan providers are C extension hooks; pgrust never constructs a CustomScan
src/backend/executor/execAmi.c:ExecReScan|NodeTag|T_CustomScanState,T_HashState	ELSEWHERE	HashJoin owns its Hash child in pgrust (no PlanStateNode::Hash variant; nodehashjoin rescans it); CustomScan UNPORTED; witness: fixtures/walker-arms-witness.sql
src/backend/executor/execCurrent.c:search_plan_tree|NodeTag|T_CustomScanState,T_ForeignScanState	UNREACHABLE	unreachable: WHERE CURRENT OF on a foreign table is refused by the planner (0A000 "not supported for this table type") before execCurrentOf runs, and a cursor over the foreign table is "not a simply updatable scan" of the base table in both trees; CustomScan UNPORTED; witness: fixtures/walker-arms-witness.sql
src/backend/executor/execProcnode.c:ExecEndNode|NodeTag|T_CustomScanState,T_HashState	ELSEWHERE	HashJoin owns its Hash child in pgrust (no PlanStateNode::Hash variant; nodehashjoin ends it); CustomScan UNPORTED; witness: fixtures/walker-arms-witness.sql
