src/backend/utils/adt/ruleutils.c:get_sublink_expr|SubLinkType|CTE_SUBLINK	NOOP	C arm is `/* shouldn't occur */ break`; Rust wildcard; witness: fixtures/walker-arms-witness.sql
contrib/postgres_fdw/postgres_fdw.c:postgresGetForeignPlan|NodeTag|T_HashJoin,T_MergeJoin,T_NestLoop	UNPORTED	postgres_fdw never generates EPQ-capable join paths, so outer_plan is always None (postgres_fdw/src/plan.rs get_foreign_plan comment); the join-plan IsA chain guards that path
