src/backend/partitioning/partprune.c:gen_partprune_steps_internal|NodeTag|T_RestrictInfo	ELSEWHERE	RestrictInfo is not dispatched as a Node in pgrust; partprune receives rinfo.clause; witness: fixtures/walker-arms-witness.sql
